{"page": 2, "segments": [{"index": 0, "text": "Input: Graph G = (V, E) (adjacency lists), source vertex s.", "rects": [[92.25, 56.24958038330078, 445.1941223144531, 70.34957885742188]], "duration": 5.175, "start_time": 0.0, "end_time": 5.175}, {"index": 1, "text": "Output: v.d = \u03b4(s, v) for all v \u2208 V; v.\u03c0 = predecessor in breadth-first\ntree.", "rects": [[92.25, 82.34723663330078, 506.5171203613281, 96.44723510742188], [92.25, 96.44798278808594, 120.8340072631836, 110.41598510742188]], "duration": 8.3, "start_time": 5.175, "end_time": 13.475000000000001}, {"index": 2, "text": "Data structures: FIFO queue Q; each vertex has color (WHITE/GRAY/\nBLACK), distance d, predecessor \u03c0.", "rects": [[92.25, 122.41364288330078, 525.1967163085938, 136.51364135742188], [92.25, 136.51438903808594, 308.406005859375, 150.48239135742188]], "duration": 7.975, "start_time": 13.475000000000001, "end_time": 21.450000000000003}, {"index": 3, "text": "Steps:", "rects": [[92.25, 162.48004150390625, 133.28424072265625, 176.58004760742188]], "duration": 1.375, "start_time": 21.450000000000003, "end_time": 22.825000000000003}, {"index": 4, "text": "Initialize: For each vertex u \u2208 G.V \u2212 {s}, set u.color = WHITE, u.d\n= \u221e, u.\u03c0 = NIL\nSet s.color = GRAY, s.d = 0, s.\u03c0 = NIL\nCreate empty queue Q, ENQUEUE(Q, s)\nWhile Q \u2260 \u00d8: \nu = DEQUEUE(Q)\nFor each vertex v in G.Adj[u]:\nIf v.color == WHITE: 8. v.color = GRAY 9.", "rects": [[122.25, 188.58079528808594, 528.1142578125, 202.54879760742188], [122.25, 202.54954528808594, 214.0740203857422, 216.51754760742188], [122.25, 216.51829528808594, 354.7980651855469, 230.48629760742188], [122.25, 230.48704528808594, 366.0420227050781, 244.45504760742188], [122.25, 244.45579528808594, 206.14198303222656, 258.4237976074219], [152.25, 258.424560546875, 262.84197998046875, 272.3925476074219], [152.25, 272.393310546875, 331.51800537109375, 286.3612976074219], [152.25, 286.362060546875, 407.9460144042969, 300.3300476074219]], "duration": 27.85, "start_time": 22.825000000000003, "end_time": 50.675000000000004}, {"index": 5, "text": "v.d = u.d + 1\nv.\u03c0 = u\nENQUEUE(Q, v)\nu.color = BLACK", "rects": [[411.76202392578125, 286.362060546875, 490.8540954589844, 300.3300476074219], [152.25, 300.330810546875, 194.72998046875, 314.2987976074219], [152.25, 314.299560546875, 252.12600708007812, 328.2675476074219], [122.25, 328.268310546875, 225.82199096679688, 342.2362976074219]], "duration": 8.25, "start_time": 50.675000000000004, "end_time": 58.925000000000004}, {"index": 6, "text": "Invariant: At the test in the while loop, Q consists of all gray vertices.", "rects": [[92.25, 354.23394775390625, 522.119873046875, 368.3339538574219]], "duration": 5.275, "start_time": 58.925000000000004, "end_time": 64.2}, {"index": 7, "text": "Complexity: O(V + E) time, \u0398(V) queue operations, each adjacency list\nscanned once.", "rects": [[92.25, 380.33160400390625, 528.9705810546875, 394.4316101074219], [92.25, 394.432373046875, 178.92601013183594, 408.4003601074219]], "duration": 7.475, "start_time": 64.2, "end_time": 71.675}, {"index": 8, "text": "Edge Cases: Vertices not reachable from s stay WHITE with d = \u221e.\nGraph can be directed or undirected.", "rects": [[92.25, 420.39801025390625, 505.8910827636719, 434.4980163574219], [92.25, 434.498779296875, 319.2060241699219, 448.4667663574219]], "duration": 8.525, "start_time": 71.675, "end_time": 80.2}, {"index": 9, "text": "Termination early: BFS can stop early if all |V| vertices have been\ndiscovered (finite d), not just when Q empties.", "rects": [[92.25, 460.46441650390625, 503.9631652832031, 474.5644226074219], [92.25, 474.565185546875, 374.1180725097656, 488.5331726074219]], "duration": 8.95, "start_time": 80.2, "end_time": 89.15}, {"index": 10, "text": "Example: On the undirected graph with vertices s (source), a, b, c\nwhere s\u2212a, s\u2212b, a\u2212c, b\u2212c:", "rects": [[92.25, 500.53082275390625, 499.0836486816406, 514.6307983398438], [92.25, 514.631591796875, 256.59002685546875, 528.5995483398438]], "duration": 9.3, "start_time": 89.15, "end_time": 98.45}, {"index": 11, "text": "Init: s.d = 0, others \u221e. Q = [s]\nDequeue s, scan neighbors a, b: set a.d = 1, b.d = 1, a.\u03c0 = s, b.\u03c0 =\ns. Q = [a, b]\nDequeue a, scan neighbors s (BLACK), c (WHITE): set c.d = 2, c.\u03c0\n= a. Q = [b, c]\nDequeue b, scan neighbors s (BLACK), c (GRAY): no change.", "rects": [[122.25, 540.600341796875, 305.1060485839844, 554.5682983398438], [122.25, 554.569091796875, 529.7222900390625, 568.5370483398438], [122.25, 568.537841796875, 195.38998413085938, 582.5057983398438], [122.25, 582.506591796875, 525.2941284179688, 596.4745483398438], [122.25, 596.475341796875, 209.82601928710938, 610.4432983398438], [122.25, 610.444091796875, 491.4541320800781, 624.4120483398438]], "duration": 26.1, "start_time": 98.45, "end_time": 124.55000000000001}, {"index": 12, "text": "Q =\n[c]\nDequeue c, scan neighbors a (BLACK), b (BLACK): no change. Q =\n[]. Done. Distances: s.d=0, a.d=1, b.d=1, c.d=2", "rects": [[495.2701416015625, 610.444091796875, 518.982177734375, 624.4120483398438], [122.25, 624.412841796875, 138.33001708984375, 638.3807983398438], [122.25, 638.381591796875, 528.84619140625, 652.3495483398438], [122.25, 652.350341796875, 174.73800659179688, 666.3182983398438], [122.25, 666.319091796875, 356.7539978027344, 680.2870483398438]], "duration": 14.725, "start_time": 124.55000000000001, "end_time": 139.275}, {"index": 13, "text": "DFS (Depth-First Search)", "rects": [[62.25, 696.91796875, 204.2521514892578, 708.620361328125]], "duration": 2.325, "start_time": 139.275, "end_time": 141.6}, {"index": 14, "text": "Type: Algorithm (graph search)", "rects": [[92.25, 725.2515869140625, 285.19537353515625, 739.3515625]], "duration": 2.4, "start_time": 141.6, "end_time": 144.0}, {"index": 15, "text": "\u2022", "rects": [[81.357421875, 56.25267028808594, 88.43742370605469, 70.22067260742188], [81.357421875,